<title>HONG KONG: Merrill Lynch sets Cheung Kong warrants.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets Cheung Kong warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co C.V. said on Wednesday it had issued 120 million American-style call warrants on Cheung Kong (Holdings) Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 HK$79	    PREMIUM	 16.38 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$1.29	  GEARING	 6.11x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   28.MAY.98	PAYDATE	 24.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING		HONG KONG	LISTING DATE  25.JUN.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     HK$79	    EXER LOT	10,000</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW	HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTE		   PHYSICAL SETTLEMENT ONLY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
